WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.109
The headline result is decisive.

00:00:02.189 --> 00:00:03.546
Measured by F1 score,

00:00:03.626 --> 00:00:08.608
GeoReasoner beats the strongest comparable
vision-language model, Qwen-VL,

00:00:08.688 --> 00:00:15.107
by just over twenty-five percent at country level
and nearly thirty-nine percent at city level,

00:00:15.187 --> 00:00:20.853
reaching a country F1 of zero point nine zero and a
city F1 of zero point eight six.

00:00:20.933 --> 00:00:23.863
Even more striking, it edges out StreetCLIP,

00:00:23.943 --> 00:00:30.567
a model built specifically for geo-localization and
trained on one point one million street views,

00:00:30.647 --> 00:00:33.645
while GeoReasoner uses only seventy thousand.

00:00:33.725 --> 00:00:39.665
The authors also show that as the fraction of
high-locatability images in training rises

00:00:39.745 --> 00:00:41.923
from zero to one hundred percent,

00:00:42.003 --> 00:00:46.780
accuracy climbs steadily, proving that the quality
of the curated data,

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:50.200
not merely its quantity, is what powers the gains.
